Subject: [PATCH ghak90 V6 06/10] audit: add support for non-syscall auxiliary records
Date:   Mon,  8 Apr 2019 23:39:13 -0400
Message-Id: <80cec372088d88040da69ebe6a4fe7be8ca8be8c.1554732921.git.rgb@redhat.com>
In-Reply-To: <cover.1554732921.git.rgb@redhat.com>
